The Meari Mini 7C has no Ethernet port. The EV200 demo DTS enables the
Synopsys GMAC, which probes without a PHY (BMCR reads 0xffff) yet still
reports link up and creates a dead eth0. Disable the controller.

--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/ak3918ev200-demb.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/ak3918ev200-demb.dts
@@ -19,6 +19,6 @@
  * them, and there is no PHY reset line: both are board wiring.
  */
 &ethernet {
-	status = "okay";
+	status = "disabled";
 };
